{"ref":"BDB, נַחְשׁוֹן","hw":"נַחְשׁוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נַחְשׁוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> son of aminadab, of Judah, brother-in-law of Aaron <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:23\" href=\"/Exodus.6.23\">Ex 6:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:7\" href=\"/Numbers.1.7\">Nu 1:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:3\" href=\"/Numbers.2.3\">2:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:13\" href=\"/Numbers.7.13\">7:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:17\" href=\"/Numbers.7.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:10\" href=\"/Numbers.7.10\">10</a>;<a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:14\" href=\"/Numbers.7.14\">14</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:20\" href=\"/Ruth.4.20\">Ru 4:20</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.10\">1 Ch 2:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.11\">11</a>. 𝔊 Ναασσων <strong>(</strong>DHM<sup>ZMG xxxvii (1883), 15</sup> cp. Sab. tribal name <span dir=\"rtl\">נחסן</span><strong>)</strong>.","next":"BDB, נָחַשׁ","prev":"BDB, נָחָשׁ²"}